@@ -1,3 +1,25 @@
 # app
 
 The example.com/app backend.
+
+## Docker
+
+Build the image from the repository root:
+
+```bash
+docker build -t example-app .
+```
+
+Run it. The server listens on port 8080:
+
+```bash
+docker run --rm -p 8080:8080 example-app
+```
+
+Check that it is up:
+
+```bash
+curl -i http://localhost:8080/healthz
+```
+
+The container runs as a non-root user (UID 65532).
